{"en": "1702821939", "title": "Menyelesaikan pengecekan sampel untuk pemesanan klinis", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "warning"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sedang dalam pengerjaan.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Halaman ini dipublikasikan sebelum peninjauannya selesai agar Anda dapat menggunakannya sekarang. Halaman ini sedang menunggu peninjauan, sehingga rinciannya masih dapat berubah. Jika ada yang tidak sesuai dengan layar Anda, tambahkan komentar pada halaman ini."}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Panduan langkah · Petugas penerimaan sampel dan petugas laboratorium", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bagian dari alur pemesanan klinis: ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Memasukkan pemesanan", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1648787462"}}, {"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " → ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Menyiapkan sampel", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1655930882"}}, {"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " → ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Pengecekan sampel", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Status: draf untuk ditinjau.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Baru untuk layar Order Entry v4 (OpenELIS 3.3.0), diuji di testing.openelis-global.org pada 7 Oktober 2026. Pengecekan sampel menggantikan langkah tinjauan QA untuk pemesanan klinis. Pemesanan lingkungan dan vektor masih menggunakan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Menyelesaikan tinjauan QA", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1429176321"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sekilas"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tujuan"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Memastikan setiap sampel dapat diterima dan merilis pemesanan ke laboratorium."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Hasil akhir"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pemesanan yang telah dirilis, dengan status "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ready for testing", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", sehingga hasil dapat dimasukkan begitu tersedia."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Siapa yang melakukan"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Petugas penerimaan sampel atau petugas laboratorium. Akses ditentukan oleh izin pengguna dan dapat dikonfigurasi oleh administrator Anda."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sebelum memulai"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pemesanan yang sampelnya telah disimpan pada "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Menyiapkan sampel", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1655930882"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lokasi"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Save and next pada Prepare Samples, atau Menu Utama → Pemesanan → Tambah Pemesanan Klinis → Pengecekan sampel"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Kapan langkah ini muncul"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pengecekan sampel adalah langkah ketiga jika laboratorium Anda menggunakan penerimaan pendaftaran (intake acceptance) untuk sampel klinis. Penerapan penerimaan diatur per domain (Off, Optional, atau Mandatory); halaman ini diambil dengan penerimaan klinis diatur ke "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Optional", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dan tanpa daftar periksa penerimaan yang dikonfigurasi."}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "warning"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jika penerimaan diatur ke Off, pemesanan diharapkan selesai di Prepare Samples tanpa langkah Pengecekan sampel. Langkah ini belum diverifikasi pada instans yang berjalan. Pastikan sebelum dipublikasikan."}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Langkah-langkah"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Buka pemesanan.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Save and next pada Prepare Samples membawa Anda ke sini dengan pemesanan sudah dimuat, dan judul halaman ditandai "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Saved", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Bilah langkah menampilkan Enter Order dan Prepare Samples sebagai "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Done", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " serta Pengecekan sampel sebagai "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ready", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; kartu pemesanan menampilkan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Samples prepared", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "2/3 steps", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tinjau penerimaan pendaftaran untuk setiap sampel.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Tabel "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Penerimaan Sampel Masuk", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Intake Acceptance", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") mencantumkan setiap sampel dengan Lab #, Sample type, Transit, dan Eligibility (misalnya "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Accepted", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Teks bantuan tabel meminta Anda memilih sampel untuk melengkapi daftar periksa penerimaannya. Panel di bawahnya menampilkan domain ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Clinical", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), waktu pengambilan dan penerimaan sampel, waktu transit, serta daftar yang aktif. Transit hanya ditampilkan sebagai acuan dan tidak menilai apa pun secara otomatis. Jika tidak ada daftar periksa yang dikonfigurasi, panel menampilkan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "No acceptance checklist is configured for this domain", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 2880, "alt": "Gambar 1. Pengecekan sampel: tabel Penerimaan Pendaftaran dengan satu sampel Serum, Accepted, dan panel daftar periksanya.", "id": "60933f97-674e-4592-90ed-3de952fe951d", "collection": "contentId-1702821939", "type": "file", "height": 1800}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar 1. Pengecekan sampel: tabel Penerimaan Pendaftaran dengan satu sampel Serum, Accepted, dan panel daftar periksanya.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Periksa ringkasannya.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Informasi Pasien", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Patient Information", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") (nama, tanggal lahir, jenis kelamin), "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ringkasan Sampel", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sample Summary", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") (setiap jenis sampel beserta pemeriksaannya), dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rincian Pemesanan", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Order Details", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") adalah bagian yang dapat diciutkan di bawahnya."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 2880, "alt": "Gambar 2. Ringkasan dan footer, dengan Rilis untuk pemeriksaan.", "id": "a03dd87e-eb02-43cd-8ac1-d61ccf050e23", "collection": "contentId-1702821939", "type": "file", "height": 1800}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar 2. Ringkasan dan footer, dengan Rilis untuk pemeriksaan.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rilis pemesanan.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Tekan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rilis untuk pemeriksaan", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Release for testing", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Bilah langkah menampilkan ketiga langkah sebagai "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Done", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", pemesanan menjadi "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ready for testing", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pada "}, {"type": "text", "text": "3/3 steps", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", dan panel penyelesaian menampilkan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Order … complete. Order entry is finished. Results can be entered as they arrive.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Kembali ke pemesanan", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Back to orders", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") membuka Order Dashboard, yang menampilkan pesan yang sama di bagian atas. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Mulai Pemesanan Baru", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Start New Order", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") tersedia di bawahnya."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 2880, "alt": "Gambar 3. Pemesanan yang telah dirilis untuk pemeriksaan, dengan panel penyelesaian.", "id": "a71ca82b-9915-4687-912d-b5c5b482ed05", "collection": "contentId-1702821939", "type": "file", "height": 1800}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar 3. Pemesanan yang telah dirilis untuk pemeriksaan, dengan panel penyelesaian.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Footer juga menyediakan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Kembali ke Siapkan Sampel", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Return to Prepare Samples", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Simpan dan keluar", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Save and exit", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Buang", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Discard", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Kembali", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Back", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Lapor KTS", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Report NCE", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tips"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pemesanan yang telah dirilis menampilkan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Buka", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Open", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), bukan Continue dan Cancel order, di Order Dashboard."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Waktu Transit adalah angka acuan. Nilailah sampel yang terlambat berdasarkan kriteria penerimaan laboratorium Anda sendiri."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Belum didokumentasikan"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Melengkapi daftar periksa penerimaan yang telah dikonfigurasi, menolak sampel, dan perilaku pada penerimaan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Mandatory", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Asal-usul"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Status"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Draf untuk ditinjau"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Instans"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "testing.openelis-global.org, OpenELIS 3.3.0-SNAPSHOT (Order Entry v4, OGC-1266). Penerapan penerimaan: klinis OPTIONAL, tanpa daftar periksa yang dikonfigurasi."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rute"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "/order/clinical/qa"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Diambil"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Diuji 7 Oktober 2026 (DEV01260000000000059); gambar 9 Oktober 2026 (DEV01260000000000099)"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Diuji"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Kedatangan dari Save and next; Rilis untuk pemeriksaan; Kembali ke pemesanan."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Hanya diamati"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Informasi Pasien, Ringkasan Sampel, Rincian Pemesanan, Kembali ke Siapkan Sampel, Simpan dan keluar, Buang, Kembali, Lapor KTS, Mulai Pemesanan Baru."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Belum diverifikasi"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Perilaku dengan penerimaan Off atau Mandatory; daftar periksa yang telah dikonfigurasi."}]}]}]}]}], "version": 1}}